Value Required STATUS (\*>[a-z]?)
Value Required PREFIX (\S+)
Value Required NEXT_HOP (\S+)
Value Required METRIC (\d+)
Value LOCAL_PREF (\d*)
Value Required WEIGHT (\d+)
Value AS_PATH (\d*(?:\s+\d+)*)
Value Required ORIGIN ([ie?])

Start
  ^\s*${STATUS}\s+${PREFIX}\s+${NEXT_HOP}\s+${METRIC}\s+${LOCAL_PREF}\s+${WEIGHT}\s+${AS_PATH}${ORIGIN}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^\s*$$
  ^.*
